#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:148
#: 4d413afca31f4f5d86cfbccd7a5ce57f
msgid "\"Center\" centers the mount (or more precisely moves it to the roll, pitch and yaw angles held in :ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_X<MNT1_NEUTRAL_X>`, :ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_Y<MNT1_NEUTRAL_Y>`, :ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_Z<MNT1_NEUTRAL_Z>`)"
