#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:150
#: 7a6a7389a9b24e59b8e1a21a67fcf421
msgid "\"Point Home\" points the mount at the home location"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:151
#: 7a6bf32ec9c3474c84010b99012c61a2
msgid "\"Retract\" retracts the mount (or more precisely moves it to the roll, pitch and yaw angles held in :ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_X<MNT1_RETRACT_X>`, :ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_Y<MNT1_RETRACT_Y>`, :ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_Z<MNT1_RETRACT_Z>`)"
