msgid "For MAVLink controlled mounts,the mount supplies its axes max and min angles. The user can override these to limit the gimbal, but this alters the defaults for those parameters and using a different MAVLink gimbal will NOT use its communicated limits unless the entire autopilot parameters are reset."
msgstr ""
